{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into bubbly underwater battles in Bubble Wars - a shared-screen party game where you and your friends pick your bubbles, customize your style, and push each other into deadly spikes to claim victory! Fight across a vibrant underwater lagoon, collect powerful pick-ups, and bump your way to glory. After all rounds are over, only one bubble champion will remain! <br>  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096770/extras/032615669b2b25b221caa39201858301.webp?t=1761503123\" width=600 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096770/extras/500a6809a4bb7c945efd3c860ce00ff5.poster.avif?t=1761503123\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096770/extras/500a6809a4bb7c945efd3c860ce00ff5.webm?t=1761503123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096770/extras/500a6809a4bb7c945efd3c860ce00ff5.mp4?t=1761503123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players can join in on the action in local shared-screen battles. Team up, face off, and laugh as you and your friends bump each other into the spikes in fast-paced underwater duels. The only thing more dangerous than the spikes are your friends! <br>   <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096770/extras/901d533d5e3468c134acb7682e3c5c54.webp?t=1761503123\" width=600 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096770/extras/fa0b1bada99715eee2db3ebe5078539b.poster.avif?t=1761503123\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096770/extras/fa0b1bada99715eee2db3ebe5078539b.webm?t=1761503123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096770/extras/fa0b1bada99715eee2db3ebe5078539b.mp4?t=1761503123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is simple: slam your opponents into the spikes before they get you first. Use clever movement, time your pushes, and grab pick-ups to gain the edge. Quick reactions and a little bit of trickery will make you the last bubble floating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096770/extras/0d9b81e7c277516ef95ef12564f97da7.webp?t=1761503123\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096770/extras/c460a6b2f6fda3061c8f944a9b3ae243.poster.avif?t=1761503123\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096770/extras/c460a6b2f6fda3061c8f944a9b3ae243.webm?t=1761503123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096770/extras/c460a6b2f6fda3061c8f944a9b3ae243.mp4?t=1761503123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your favorite bubble color, change your name, and top it all off with a silly hat. Stand out in the lagoon and make your bubble your own \u2013 whether you want to look cool, goofy, or absolutely bubblelicious.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4096770?t=1761503123","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4096770?t=1761503123","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096770/79826ce5f8ff56103c7ec784df196fb4737028aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761503123","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096770/79826ce5f8ff56103c7ec784df196fb4737028aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761503123","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into bubbly underwater battles in Bubble Wars - a shared-screen party game where you and your friends pick your bubbles, customize your style, and push each other into deadly spikes to claim victory! Fight across a vibrant underwater lagoon, collect powerful pick-ups, and bump your way to glory. After all rounds are over, only one bubble champion will remain! <br>  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096770/extras/032615669b2b25b221caa39201858301.webp?t=1761503123\" width=600 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096770/extras/500a6809a4bb7c945efd3c860ce00ff5.poster.avif?t=1761503123\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096770/extras/500a6809a4bb7c945efd3c860ce00ff5.webm?t=1761503123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096770/extras/500a6809a4bb7c945efd3c860ce00ff5.mp4?t=1761503123\" type=\"video/